  "contracts": [
    "Bridge direction counts actual water/piece neighbors at distances1/2; ties use vertical stride228. Traversal reaches the true segment beginning, has no invented cap and preserves full segment marking/removal/count side effects.",
    "47F9B0 counts nonzero signedWORD actor IDs and clears preview bit40 on every visited bridge tile. 47F810 nonzero mark does not remove pieces; zero clears piece BYTE and terrain40 only.",
    "4F4930 keeps the signedWORD subtype/root adaptation, BYTE size, true complex-offset predicate, mode5 segment output reload and all7 actual surface refreshes.",
    "4F5E70 reads actual regular/mastaba DWORD offsets by root size, captures genuine building undo before reserving type215, increments shared BC971C with DWORD wrap, and restores state2 when reserveBYTE is zero.",
    "4E9350 uses the actual RNG pool index without advancing the shared index, removes random ages until100 misses, then scans ages starting10. WORD counts, DWORD remaining counter and signed comparisons preserved.",
    "4E9250 maintains actual displaced/population/highest values; normalized C state is not a Native overlay. Native city bank stride49D8; population24, ages25C4, displaced26F8, highest469C.",
    "474380 consumers observe AL only; int32 C result normalizes that Boolean and does not claim unspecified upper EAX.",
    "4264D0 normalized popup state stores actual callback pointer, key, mode and location/window/redraw changes. Previous Native window70570C is DWORD zero-extended from BYTE E38DDA; normalized C previous_window remains a logical BYTE."
  ],
